---
layout: layouts/base.njk
pageTitle: "Student Profile & Learning Dashboard — EnglishVidya"
metaDescription: "Manage your EnglishVidya profile, review saved chapter bookmarks, track daily learning streaks, and access your vocabulary notes."
permalink: /profile/
schemaJson: |
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "ProfilePage",
    "name": "Student Profile",
    "description": "Personalized learning dashboard for EnglishVidya students."
  }
---

<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-6 sm:py-10 px-4 sm:px-6">
  
  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <!-- 1. GUEST / LOGGED-OUT PROMPT (VISIBLE WHEN NOT LOGGED IN) -->
